<!-- wp:mbn-theme/practice-area-details {"sections":[{"id":"whyHire-default","type":"whyHire","title":{"heading":"Why Hire Hastings & Hastings?","paragraphs":["Hastings & Hastings combines experience and dedication to ensure you are fairly compensated for any damages incurred as the result of an accident. Here’s why you should work with us:"],"backgroundColor":"bg-white"},"data":{"heading":"","subtitle":"","features":[{"id":"feature1","title":"Millions Recovered for Personal Injury Clients","description":"<p>Our firm has recovered millions of dollars in compensation for personal injury clients, helping accident victims pursue the financial recovery they need after serious and unexpected injuries.</p>"},{"id":"feature2","title":"Over 40 Years Serving Arizona Injury Victims","description":"<p>Our team has served Arizona natives for over 40 years and is well-versed in Arizona accident law, giving clients experienced guidance through the claims process.</p>"},{"id":"feature3","title":"Trusted by Repeat Clients and Referrals","description":"<p>The majority of our business comes from repeat clients and referrals, demonstrating a high level of satisfaction with our services and the trust clients place in our team.</p>"}],"photoUrl":"","photoId":0,"badge90YearsUrl":"","badge90YearsId":0,"mapBackgroundUrl":"","mapBackgroundId":0,"badgeNoFeeUrl":"","badgeNoFeeId":0,"freeEvaluationsTitle":"We Offer Free Case Evaluations","freeEvaluationsDescription":"<p>When it comes to hiring a lawyer, cost is always a concern. Many people avoid hiring an attorney because they think they can't afford it, but that's not always the case. At our firm, we offer free case evaluations so that potential clients can find out about their legal options without having to worry about how much it will cost. During your free evaluation, one of our experienced boat accident attorneys will sit down with you and review the facts of your case at no cost or obligation on your part.</p>","millionsRecoveredTitle":"","millionsRecoveredDescription":""}},{"id":"cta1-default","type":"cta","title":{"heading":"","paragraphs":[],"backgroundColor":"bg-light-blue"},"data":{"logoUrl":"","logoId":0,"textureUrl":"","textureId":0,"heading":"Start Your Free Consultation","subtext":"Contact the discount accident lawyers at Hastings and Hastings today.","buttonText":"Start your free consultation now!","buttonUrl":"#contact","phoneLabel":"Call Today","phoneNumber":"(480) 480-2929"}},{"id":"afterAccident-default","type":"afterAccident","title":{"heading":"<span class="pad-text-blue">How a Boat Accident Lawyer</span> Can Help With Your Claim","paragraphs":["The majority of people, even boat owners, become easily overwhelmed in the aftermath of an accident. A boat accident lawyer will facilitate the entire process and can especially help with:"],"backgroundColor":"bg-white"},"data":{"heading":"Determining Liability","splits":[{"id":"split1","text":"<p>A <a href="/">Phoenix injury lawyer</a> is best positioned to determine whether you have a case and who is most likely to be liable for your damages.</p>","imageUrl":"https://hastingsandhastings.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/boat-img1.jpg","imageId":11011,"layout":"text-left"},{"id":"split2","text":"<h3 class="pad-section-heading">Evidence Gathering</h3>\n<p>The open water can make physical evidence a little more difficult to collect, but a lawyer will use the police report, eyewitness testimony, and expert witnesses to support your case.</p>","imageUrl":"https://hastingsandhastings.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/boat-img2.jpg","imageId":11012,"layout":"image-left"},{"id":"split3","text":"<h3 class="pad-section-heading">Claims Filing and Negotiation</h3>\n<p>Insurance companies often require extremely precise technical documents and language, which can confuse any accident victim. A lawyer will assist in cutting through the red tape and ensure that all claims are filed appropriately and will negotiate on your behalf. </p>","imageUrl":"https://hastingsandhastings.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/boat-img3.jpg","imageId":11013,"layout":"text-left"}]}},{"id":"compensation-default","type":"compensation","title":{"heading":"","paragraphs":["Insurance companies often require extremely precise technical documents and language, which can confuse any accident victim. A lawyer will assist in cutting through the red tape and ensure that all claims are filed appropriately and will negotiate on your behalf. "],"backgroundColor":"bg-white"},"data":{"heading":"<span class="pad-text-blue">Common Causes</span> of Boat Accidents","subtitle":"Boating accidents are usually caused by similar reasons as routine traffic accidents but come with their own complications. Most boating accidents are caused by:","items":[{"id":"comp1","title":"Intoxication","description":"<p>Unfortunately, many people associate boating with drinking, regardless of the reason for being on the water. Intoxication impairs reaction time and leads to reckless driving. Boating while intoxicated is illegal and extremely dangerous. </p>"},{"id":"comp3","title":"Aggressive Driving","description":"<p>Boaters often get carried away and attempt tricks or high speeds, which can easily lead to crashes and serious injuries.</p>"},{"id":"comp2","title":"Equipment Malfunction:","description":"<p>Boats are exposed to constant wear-and-tear and can easily stall or break down on the open water. Boats that aren’t properly maintained and inspected are at risk of obstructing the waterways and causing other boats to crash into them. </p>"},{"id":"comp4","title":"","description":"<p>Boating may look simple from afar, but there are <a href="https://www.azgfd.com/boating/register-and-renew-your-registration/rules-and-regulations/?__cf_chl_f_tk=nRp8PtvzoYBXS.EHPVERrX.52GCfv445di9SWPJhytE-1783176419-1.0.1.1-vfqYBeczmSK5FNDpaHziKQ6KPUarwC5uz.ieOx4.zr0" target="_blank">numerous regulations</a> at play and safety concerns that arise on the open water. Caution should be exercised anytime you operate this type of vehicle and be prepared for any eventuality. </p>","featured":true}]}},{"id":"liability-default","type":"liability","title":{"heading":"","paragraphs":[],"backgroundColor":"bg-light-blue"},"data":{"heading":"<span class="pad-text-blue">Potential Liability</span> in Boat Accident Claims","subtitle":"Here are some of the most common types of compensation you may be entitled to after a boat accident: ","items":[{"id":"liability1","term":"Driver(s)","description":"<p>Often, an accident’s cause can be attributed to one of the boat drivers. In such cases, they or their insurance company may be liable for damages.  </p>"},{"id":"liability2","term":"Owner of the Boat","description":"<p>In rare cases, a passenger can be liable for the accident if they caused a distraction or otherwise impaired the driver’s function, leading to an accident.</p>"},{"id":"mr6j3f2wg05v33gg5g","term":"Passenger","description":"<p>In rare cases, a passenger can be liable for the accident if they caused a distraction or otherwise impaired the driver’s function, leading to an accident. </p>"},{"id":"liability3","term":"Boat Manufacturer","description":"<p>Like car accidents, manufacturers can be liable for accidents through product liability if it can be demonstrated that faulty construction or equipment malfunctioning caused the accident. </p>"},{"term":"Marina/Dock Owner","description":"<p>Dock owners can be liable for any accident caused by improper maintenance of the docking area or environmental conditions at the dock. </p>","id":"mr6hfwyxecw6pjyol49"}]}},{"id":"mr6h4mbohxbzead19c5","type":"compensation","title":{"heading":"","paragraphs":[],"backgroundColor":"bg-light-blue"},"data":{"heading":"<span class="pad-text-blue">Recoverable Damages</span> in Boat Accident Claims","subtitle":"After a boating accident, you may be entitled to compensation. Common types include:","items":[{"id":"mr6h4mbofajmm3rp75g","title":"Economic","description":"<p>Economic damages are often the simplest and consist of property damage, healthcare expenses, and lost wages.</p>"},{"id":"mr6h4mboq6j7aucdz1","title":"Punitive","description":"Boats are expensive to maintain and repair, and accidents come with a variety of costs. A boating accident lawyer can help you recover compensation for those damages."},{"id":"mr6h4mboa9tqbaho1fo","title":"Non-economic","description":"The damage from accidents is not always easily quantified by a dollar amount. Damages can be awarded for pain and suffering and emotional distress following the accident. "},{"id":"mr6h4mbo24pxf10voud","title":"","description":"<p>Boats are expensive to maintain and repair, and accidents come with a variety of costs. A boating accident lawyer can help you recover compensation for those damages.</p>","featured":true}]}},{"id":"documentation-default","type":"documentation","title":{"heading":"","paragraphs":[],"backgroundColor":"bg-light-blue"},"data":{"heading":"<span class="pad-text-blue">Contact Hastings & Hastings</span> to Schedule Your Free Consultation","text":"<p>Our team at Hastings & Hastings is skilled and experienced in handling boat accident claims. We can help you determine liability, recover compensation, and assist you in every step of the claims process. While accidents range in severity, all of them are stressful and lead to paperwork and navigating complex systems like claims processing. A lawyer can give you peace of mind and assist throughout the entire process. Contact us now for a free consultation if you or someone you know has been involved in a boating accident.</p>","photoUrl":"https://hastingsandhastings.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/img-location-hastings-attorneys.jpg","photoId":10131}},{"id":"attorneys-default","type":"attorneys","title":{"heading":"","paragraphs":[],"backgroundColor":"bg-light-blue"},"data":{"heading":"<span class="pad-text-blue">Our Accident & Injury Attorneys</span> Can Help","text":"<p>At Hastings and Hastings we understand that boat accidents can cause all types of injuries. These injuries can range from neck and back pain, to much more severe and permanent injuries, or in the worst case — a <a href="/practice-areas/wrongful-death/">fatality</a>. Hastings and Hastings offers over 90 years of combined legal experience in handling all types of accident injuries and we urge you to call now to schedule an appointment to meet with an experienced Phoenix boat accident attorney.</p>","photoUrl":"","photoId":0,"badgeCards":[{"id":"badge1","imageUrl":"","imageId":0,"description":"You pay nothing upfront and nothing out of pocket. Hastings & Hastings only gets paid if your case results in a recovery."},{"id":"badge2","imageUrl":"","imageId":0,"description":"Hastings & Hastings is known for its 29% settlement fee, giving clients a more affordable way to get experienced legal representation."},{"id":"badge3","imageUrl":"","imageId":0,"description":"Compared to firms that charge 33%, our lower fee structure gives Hastings & Hastings a meaningful cost advantage."}]}}]} /-->

